# The repository root ignores `*.pdf`, and correctly so: Twelve-Factor VI forbids
# local file writes that outlive a request, and every artifact Ratepin generates in
# production streams to R2 rather than to disk.
#
# These four are the exception, and they are the opposite of a generated artifact:
# they are ORACLES. `golden.test.ts` compares today's renderer against them byte for
# byte, which is the RENDER_DIFF gate of `ENGINE.md` §27 — "is the page a customer
# downloads today the page they downloaded last month?". An ignored oracle is a test
# that passes on a fresh clone because there is nothing to compare against, which is
# the worst kind of green.
#
# Re-including works here because the DIRECTORY is not excluded, only the pattern;
# git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded directory, but it can re-include a
# file matched by a pattern.
!*.pdf
